Package: datasuite.ui
Title: Shiny Interface, Chart Options and Report Builder for DataSuite Apps
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
      person("David", "Kariuki", , "hello@damurka.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-6159-1107")),
      person("African Population and Health Research Center (APHRC)",
            role = c("cph", "fnd"))
    )
Description: The shared interface of DataSuite's Shiny apps: chart options that restyle
    any 'ggplot2' chart (texts, fonts, colours, axes, legend, show or hide an element),
    a Word-like report builder writing Word, PowerPoint and PDF files, and the
    Shiny and React components, page frame and navigation the apps are built from.
    It holds nothing specific to one app's data: an app gives it its pages, its
    charts and its data through small interfaces.
